### 12. UNUSUAL INCIDENT TRACKER DIRECTORY

A dedicated Unusual Incident Tracker Directory should be developed.

Currently, unusual incident records and related documents are maintained in Google Drive.

The new module should centralize access to these records.

**Features:**

- Admin can add Google Drive folder/document links.
- Admin can edit or remove links.
- Records can be categorized date-wise.
- Records can be categorized incident-wise.
- Records can be categorized lobby-wise.
- Incident title and brief description can be maintained.
- Relevant documents and reports can be linked.

**Access Permissions:**

| User | Permission |
|---|---|
| Admin | Full access – Add/Edit/Delete |
| Officers | View |
| TLC | View |
| PCNL | View |
| CLI | As authorized |
| Crew | No access by default |

The module should function as a searchable directory of unusual incidents.

